    category: "Three-stage dual-motor standing desk",
    badge: "Best Overall",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GN9MB83G?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nE-oQdlxL._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":500},
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "About $480 (Amazon, 9 Nov 2026)",
    priceBounds: {"low":480,"high":480},
    specs: "24.4 to 50.0 in. · dual motor, 3-stage legs · 330 lb capacity in the listing text (352 lb in its title) · 48 x 24 in. solid acacia top · bevelled edges",
    pros: [
      "Highest maximum on this page, at 50.0 inches",
      "Dual motors and three-stage legs",
      "High load rating suggests a stiff frame",
      "Solid acacia top with bevelled edges for forearms",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Listing gives two different capacities, 330 and 352 lb",
      "24 in. depth is shallow for walking; deeper sizes cost more",
      "The listing we read gives no warranty term",
    ],
    bottomLine: "For an average-height or taller walker who needs every inch a standing desk can give.",
    description: "For a walking desk, the most important figure on a standing desk listing is the maximum height, and the E6 MAX has the highest we found among mainstream desks: 24.4 to 50.0 inches, from a dual-motor frame with three-stage legs. FlexiSpot describes it as built for a wide height range and users of all heights. The listing describes a heavy-duty frame, but gives two load figures, 330 lb in the text and 352 lb in the title; either is high, and generally indicates a stiff, heavy frame. The size we looked up has a 48 by 24 inch top in solid acacia with bevelled edges, which are kinder to forearms resting on the edge while walking. It was about $480 on Amazon on 9 November 2026. The listing we read gives no warranty term, so check before buying. The 24 inch depth is the main compromise for walking; if a deeper top is offered in your finish, take it. By the rule of thumb on our height page, a 50 inch maximum serves a walker up to roughly 5 ft 11 in. on a slim pad.",
  },
  {
    id: "flexispot-e6-bamboo",
    name: "FlexiSpot E6 Bamboo 3-Stage Dual Motor Electric Standing Desk 55 x 28",
    brand: "FlexiSpot",
    category: "Three-stage dual-motor standing desk",
    badge: "Tall and Wide",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYF1SRQ?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PnkwnA3VL._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":500},
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "About $330 (Amazon, 9 Nov 2026)",
    priceBounds: {"low":330,"high":330},
    specs: "23.6 to 49.2 in. · dual motor, 3-stage legs · 220 lb capacity · 55 x 28 in. bamboo top · under 45 dB claimed · 5-year frame and motor, 2-year electronics warranty",
    pros: [
      "Reaches 49.2 inches from three-stage legs and dual motors",
      "55 in. width gives room for a pad between the feet",
      "28 in. depth, deeper than the E6 MAX size above",
      "Five-year warranty on frame and motor",
    ],
    cons: [
      "220 lb capacity, lower than the E6 MAX and UPLIFT",
      "Ships in two boxes and weighs about 100 lb",
      "Bamboo top needs care with spills",
    ],
    bottomLine: "For a walker who wants a three-stage frame and a wide, deep top for less than premium prices.",
    description: "The E6 Bamboo is FlexiSpot's three-stage dual-motor frame with a solid bamboo top, and for a walking desk it offers a good balance of height, size and price. The listing gives a range of 23.6 to 49.2 inches, less than an inch short of the E6 MAX, with dual motors that FlexiSpot says run under 45 decibels and lift up to 220 lb. The top we looked up is 55 by 28 inches, which gives more width between the feet for a walking pad and more depth than a standard 24 inch desk. FlexiSpot covers the frame and motor for five years and the controller and electronics for two. Amazon lists the weight at 100 lb; it ships in two boxes. It was about $330 on Amazon on 9 November 2026. The trade-off against the E6 MAX is a lower load rating; for a typical monitor-and-laptop set-up, 220 lb is ample. By our height page's rule of thumb, a 49.2 inch maximum serves walkers up to roughly 5 ft 10 in. on a slim pad.",
  },
  {
    id: "uplift-v3-essential",
    name: "UPLIFT DESK V3 Essential Electric Standing Desk, 46\" x 24\"",
    brand: "UPLIFT Desk",
    category: "Commercial-standard three-stage standing desk",
    badge: "Most Stable",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HKSVRRHK?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/313uwQAc-0L._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":500},
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "About $469 (Amazon, 9 Nov 2026)",
    priceBounds: {"low":469,"high":469},
    specs: "22.6 to 48.7 in. · 3-stage dual motors, 1.5 in./s · 250 lb capacity · ANSI/BIFMA · 46 x 24 in. top · USB-C and USB-A on keypad · 5-year warranty",
    pros: [
      "Meets ANSI/BIFMA commercial standards, per the listing",
      "Tested for over 20,000 cycles, with threadlocked screws",
      "Three-stage dual motors reach 48.7 in.",
      "Cable management kit and USB charging included",
      "Full five-year warranty",
    ],
    cons: [
      "46 x 24 in. top is small and shallow for walking",
      "Maximum is lower than the FlexiSpot E6 desks",
      "Narrow top may leave tight clearance for a wide pad",
    ],
    bottomLine: "For a walker who values a steady frame from a desk specialist and is under about 5 ft 9 in.",
    description: "UPLIFT is one of the best-known standing desk brands, and the V3 Essential is its all-in-one, single-box version of the V3. The listing gives a height range of 22.6 to 48.7 inches from three-stage dual motors moving at 1.5 inches per second, a 250 lb lift capacity, and, most usefully for a walking desk, a statement that it meets ANSI/BIFMA commercial office standards and has been tested for more than 20,000 cycles, with threadlocked machine screws for long-term stability. A four-preset keypad has USB-C and USB-A charging ports, and the package includes UPLIFT's cable manager and magnetic channels. The top is a 46 by 24 inch walnut laminate. UPLIFT gives a full five-year warranty. Amazon lists the weight at 68.8 lb. It was about $469 on Amazon on 9 November 2026. The drawbacks for walking are the small, shallow top and a maximum below the FlexiSpot E6 desks, which by our rule of thumb suits walkers up to about 5 ft 9 in. on a slim pad. Measure the clearance between the feet against your pad.",
  },
  {
    id: "vivo-desk-kit-1b6b-30",
    name: "VIVO Electric Standing Desk, 60\" x 30\" (DESK-KIT-1B6B-30)",
    brand: "VIVO",
    category: "Single-motor standing desk with a deep top",
    badge: "Best Deep Desk",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CH1V1MVG?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
