        <div id="height-range" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Will the Desk Go High Enough? A Quick Check</h2>
<p>
            The full method, with a chart by user height, is on our page on <a href="/standing-desk-height-for-walking-pad/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">standing desk height for a walking pad</a>.
            Its rule of thumb is that the desk should sit at your standing elbow height in shoes plus
            the pad's deck height, and that barefoot elbow height is roughly 0.63 times your overall
            height. Applying that page's assumptions (an inch of shoe, a 4 inch slim pad or a 6 inch
            incline pad lying flat) to the maximum heights of the desks here gives a rough idea of
            who each one can serve.
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[480px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead><tr>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Desk</th>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Listed maximum</th>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Approx. tallest user, 4 in. pad</th>
              <th class="text-left font-black text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-200 py-2 pr-4">Approx. tallest user, 6 in. pad</th>
            </tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">FlexiSpot E6 MAX</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">50.0 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 11 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 8 in.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">FlexiSpot E6 Bamboo</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">49.2 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 10 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 7 in.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">UPLIFT V3 Essential</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">48.7 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 9 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 6 in.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">VIVO DESK-KIT-1B6B-30</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">48.4 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 8 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 5 in.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">FEZIBO 55 x 30</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">46.5 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 5 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 2 in.</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">FlexiSpot EN1</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">45.7 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 4 in.</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About 5 ft 1 in.</td></tr>
